  "query": "-- Windows whose five minutes have ended by the database clock, oldest first.\nSELECT\n    w.scope,\n    w.start_at,\n    w.end_at,\n    w.collection,\n    w.template,\n    w.reads,\n    w.not_modified,\n    w.failed,\n    w.members_digest\nFROM audit.indexing_window AS w\nWHERE w.end_at <= now()\nORDER BY w.end_at\nLIMIT 32\n",
